        <p>The following are the local matches for the second round to be played to-day :—Warrington Bull's Head v llrmston Victoria, at Cobden Hotel ; Rylands v Swinton Liberal at A igan Subscription ; Warrington Cemetery v Didsbury Hotel at Roebuck, Fliston.</p>
