        <p>SUCCESS OF "PRINTERS' PIE." LAST YEAR'S RECORD BROKEN.</p>
        <p>" Printers' Pie" will be in the hands of the public on Mcnday, May 13th. The whole of this year's orders largely exceed those of last year. The order given by Messrs. W. B. Smith and Son is the largest for any annual of this kind, viz. : 76,002. A record has also been established by Messrs. Wyman, Messrs. Menzies of Scotland, or d Messrs. Easons of Ireland. Last year's " Printers', Pie" wes a record as far as sale was con- cerned, and the orders for 1912 tend to show that very few copies will be loft more than a day or two after publication.</p>
